<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Vehicle Card Body"}}},"decoration":{"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"30px","right":"30px","bottom":"30px","left":"30px","syncVertical":"on","syncHorizontal":"on"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"20px","right":"20px","bottom":"20px","left":"20px","syncVertical":"on","syncHorizontal":"on"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<div class=\"bd-vehicle-card-body\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#353740;line-height:1.25em;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">Spacious SUVs &amp; High-Roof Vans</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#747d88;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55em;\">Immaculately maintained vehicles equipped for families traveling with luggage, strollers, and beach gear.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#4d5661;line-height:1.3em;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Child &amp; infant safety seats pre-installed on request</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#4d5661;line-height:1.3em;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Chilled bottled water &amp; crisp air conditioning included</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#4d5661;line-height:1.3em;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Ample luggage room for bags, strollers &amp; golf clubs</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#4d5661;line-height:1.3em;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\" stroke=\"#141630\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Direct non-stop transfer \u2014 no multiple resort stops</span></li></ul></div>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.11.1"} /-->
